<p class="md-p">面积由两端较短的高度和间距决定。若保留短边只移动长边，宽度变小、高度上限仍被短边限制，不可能超过当前面积；因此可以安全丢弃短边，再寻找更高的边。</p>
<p class="md-p">解法：</p>
<div class="md-list-wrap"><ul class="md-list md-depth-0"><li>面积由较短边决定。</li><li>每次移动较短边，才可能得到更大高度。</li><li>移动较长边不会改善当前短板。</li></ul></div>
<p class="md-p">输入格式：第一行 n，第二行 n 个整数表示高度。</p>
<section class="code-card md-code-card"><div class="code-toolbar"><div class="toolbar-left"><span class="window-dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="file-label">双指针总结.java</span></div><button class="copy-button md-copy" type="button">复制代码</button></div><div class="code-scroll"><pre class="md-pre" data-lang="java">import java.util.*;

public class Main {
    public static int solve(int[] height) {
        int left = 0, right = height.length - 1;
        int ans = 0;
        // 左右指针向中间收缩，每次移动较短边
        while (left &lt; right) {
            int area = Math.min(height[left], height[right]) * (right - left);
            ans = Math.max(ans, area);
            if (height[left] &lt; height[right]) {
                left++;
            } else {
                right--;
            }
        }
        return ans;
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);
        int n = sc.nextInt();
        int[] height = new int[n];
        for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) {
            height[i] = sc.nextInt();
        }
        System.out.println(solve(height));
    }
}</pre></div></section>